# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# Test projects (not needed for runtime)
**/*.Tests/

# Node modules (frontend)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/

# IDE files
**/.idea/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/

# Git
**/.git/
**/.gitignore

# Documentation
**/*.md
**/docs/

# Test results
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/

# Temporary files
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/tmp/
